msgstr "[Algorithme de Shor](/tutorials/shors-algorithm)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm)\n"
msgstr "[Algorithme de Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm)\n"

